Description:  Provides VLAN subnet management RPC interface (vlan_subnet).
 DSA independent bridge model: br-lan / br-guest / br-iot / br-vlanN.
 Supports main/guest/IOT/custom subnet CRUD, address reservation,
 lifecycle migration, mode switching, client view, and VPN interface linkage.
